{
  "$schema": "../recipe.schema.json",
  "id": "egov-population-dataset-search",
  "title": {
    "ja": "e-Govで人口データセットを探す",
    "en": "Find population datasets in e-Gov"
  },
  "question": {
    "ja": "e-Govデータポータルで人口に関する公開データセットを探せるか。",
    "en": "Can we find public datasets about population in the e-Gov Data Portal?"
  },
  "source_id": "egov-data-portal",
  "request": {
    "method": "GET",
    "url": "https://data.e-gov.go.jp/data/api/action/package_search?q=%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%A3&rows=2&start=0",
    "allowed_hosts": ["data.e-gov.go.jp"],
    "headers": {
      "Accept": "application/json"
    }
  },
  "expect": {
    "status": 200,
    "content_type_contains": "application/json",
    "max_bytes": 500000,
    "assertions": [
      {
        "pointer": "/success",
        "equals": true
      },
      {
        "pointer": "/result/count",
        "minimum": 1
      },
      {
        "pointer": "/result/results",
        "min_length": 2
      }
    ]
  },
  "result": {
    "fields": [
      {
        "name": "match-count",
        "label": {
          "ja": "検索一致件数",
          "en": "Matching datasets"
        },
        "pointer": "/result/count",
        "unit": "件"
      },
      {
        "name": "first-title",
        "label": {
          "ja": "先頭のデータセット",
          "en": "First dataset"
        },
        "pointer": "/result/results/0/title"
      },
      {
        "name": "first-publisher",
        "label": {
          "ja": "先頭データセットの提供者",
          "en": "First dataset publisher"
        },
        "pointer": "/result/results/0/publisher"
      },
      {
        "name": "second-title",
        "label": {
          "ja": "2件目のデータセット",
          "en": "Second dataset"
        },
        "pointer": "/result/results/1/title"
      }
    ]
  },
  "interpretation": [
    "これはデータカタログの検索結果であり、個別データの値そのものではありません。",
    "検索結果の各resourceについて、形式、更新日、URL、個別ライセンスを追加確認してください。",
    "検索順位と一致件数は、ポータルの収録内容や検索索引の更新によって変わります。"
  ],
  "attribution": {
    "source_url": "https://data.e-gov.go.jp/data/ja/api_guide",
    "license_url": "https://www.digital.go.jp/resources/open_data/public_data_license_v1.0",
    "credit": "出典：e-Govデータポータル（https://data.e-gov.go.jp/）"
  },
  "last_verified": "2026-07-24"
}
